Let $\mathcal A$ be a cluster algebra with coefficient semifield $\mathbb P$ and $A_{k;t_0}$ a cluster variable of $\mathcal A$. Let $t$ be a seed of $\mathcal A$ and $M=A_{1;t}^{c_1}\cdots A_{n;t}^{c_n}$ a cluster monomial in $t$. Denote $I=\{i\mid c_i>0\}$. The following statements hold.
\begin{itemize}
